  playerName: KIM
  personalityNotes: 'THE WALL. Deepest conceding fear on the roster; screening the
    lane between ball and own goal pays continuously (defensivePositionScale, her
    signature trait). Patient - a draw barely stings, does not swarm, comfortable
    near the goal line (low wall penalty), disciplined smooth movement. Same total
    incentive budget as everyone (2.2 / 0.0016) - spent on defense. Weakness by design:
    scores rarely.'
